; ACTOR COMPENSATION for the Gunslinger cartridge port (2026-08-09).
; GS cartridges carry a much lower k_hit than the stock CS ones (5.45 fmj 0.33 vs 1.0); on the
; NPC side that is paid back by the raised bone factors in m_stalker.ltx, but the actor has no
; such raise, so without this he would end up ~1.6x tankier on average. 1.57 is the weighted
; mean of old/new bullet power over the calibres NPCs actually carry, at our armour tiers --
; it puts the actor's average time-to-die back exactly where it was. ONE KNOB: scale every
; non-zero hit_scale below together if you want the player tougher (lower) or softer (higher).
; Per-calibre this is not flat -- GS's own balance now shows through: 5.45/5.56 hurt ~0.6-0.8x
; of what they did, buckshot ~1.6x, 7.62x54 ~2.4x.
